{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Reform the limitation period for NHS clinical negligence claims for stillbirth",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "I urge the UK Government to change the law so that parents of stillborn babies caused by NHS clinical negligence are not prevented from bringing a claim solely because more than three years have passed. Families dealing with bereavement, often spend years focused on surviving.",
